  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards Effective Courts and Coordinated Labor Justice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridge II will continue to improve forced labor research methods and build in-country research capacity, and advance policy, law enforcement, legal justice, and victim remedies. The project will establish innovative strategic partnerships and support coordinated efforts at all levels of governance and with workers, employers, and civil society organizations to respond effectively to the challenge of forced labor.</narrative>
  </description>
